    tmk:authoringReasoning "The Manual states the required danger threshold for deception or confusion arising from a connotation. I infer the relationship to the anchor through that consequence; the threshold does not govern whether a connotation exists."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 8.8e-01 ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "Whether statesThresholdFor should target deception or confusion instead of connotation."@en-AU ;
