    tmk:spanEnd 911 ;
    tmk:spanStart 609 ;
    tmk:supportingText "There are no other elements in the mark, or surrounding circumstances, which would mitigate the risk of confusion. Surrounding circumstances include the manner in which the goods/services are purchased, the physical characteristics of goods and any other factor which would affect consumer perceptions." ;
