    tmk:authoringBasis "corpus_inferred" ;
    tmk:authoringReasoning "The Manual treats the connection between the specified goods/services and the person's field of renown as affecting the likelihood of an implied association. I infer a qualifying relationship to connotation, with some uncertainty because the operative factor is the contextual connection rather than the person alone."@en-AU ;
