    tmk:authoringReasoning "The Manual identifies a plant variety name connoted by the mark as a potential source of a section 43 ground, conditional on its use for plants or plant materials of the same or a closely related genus. It does not make the name alone a sufficient basis."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 9.7e-01 ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "Whether the relationship should attach more narrowly to the connotation of the plant variety name."@en-AU ;
    tmk:extractionMethod "agent_authoring" ;
    tmk:goldRecord "GR-0090" ;
