    tmk:supportingText "It is clear from both the Oregon and Sports Warehouse decisions (as well as from other decisions from the Courts) that once the Registrar is satisfied on the balance of probabilities that a ground for rejection does exist, then the presumption of registrability no longer forms a part of the Registrar’s decision making process." ;
    tmk:tier 3 .

