    tmk:authoringBasis "corpus_inferred" ;
    tmk:authoringReasoning "The Manual reproduces judicial principles requiring consideration of surrounding circumstances when assessing likelihood of deception or confusion. Reading this with principle (i), those circumstances inform assessment of the real tangible danger threshold, rather than alter that threshold."@en-AU ;
