    tmk:spanEnd 1277 ;
    tmk:spanStart 891 ;
    tmk:supportingText "For example, deception or confusion could arise in regard to the: Character of the goods and/or services including their composition, nature or other properties Quality or quantity of the goods and/or services Geographical origin of the goods and/or services Intended use or purpose of the goods and/or services Connection in the mind of the buying public with a person or organisation." ;
