    tmk:authoringReasoning "The statutory wording reproduced in the Manual supports nearly resembling defence emblems as a potential basis for unlawful use, subject to the stated membership and written-authority conditions. The connection to the general use-contrary-to-law ground is inferred rather than expressly stated for this example."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 8.6e-01 ;
