    tmk:supportingText "The two key enquiries under s 44 are whether the respective trade marks are substantially identical or deceptively similar, and whether the respective goods/services are similar or closely related." ;
    tmk:tier 2 .

tmka:GR-0225 a tmk:AuthoredAssertion ;
