    tmk:spanEnd 696 ;
    tmk:spanStart 464 ;
    tmk:supportingText "As with national applications, IP Australia will routinely expedite IRDAs with a convention claim in order to minimise the risk of a trade mark with an earlier priority date being overlooked in the examination of other applications." ;
    tmk:tier 2 .

