    tmk:spanEnd 440 ;
    tmk:spanStart 175 ;
    tmk:supportingText "Deferment of acceptance is where the period of time that is allowed under subsection 37(1) and reg 4.12 for an application to gain acceptance is set in abeyance - deferred - because a request for deferment has been made and/or certain conditions are met (reg 4.13)." ;
    tmk:tier 2 .

