    tmk:spanEnd 1354 ;
    tmk:spanStart 1035 ;
    tmk:supportingText "Collective trade marks cannot be assigned (section 166) and therefore no details of the assignment are to be entered on the database. The applicant for the assignment should be advised that the recordal of assignment cannot proceed. Certification trade marks can be assigned and follow the usual process for assignment." ;
    tmk:tier 2 .

