    tmk:spanEnd 211 ;
    tmk:spanStart 0 ;
    tmk:supportingText "Section 163(1) of the Act provides that except for Part 10 of the Act (Assignment and Transmission of Trade Marks), a collective trade mark is to be considered in the equivalent manner to an ordinary trade mark." ;
    tmk:tier 2 .

