    tmk:spanEnd 1241 ;
    tmk:spanStart 984 ;
    tmk:supportingText "In some cases it may be considered that the trade mark has no inherent adaptation to distinguish and the applicant would therefore need to show sufficient evidence that the trade mark did distinguish the applicant's goods or services, at the date of filing." ;
    tmk:tier 3 .

