tmkc:GC-0150 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:InstrumentOrRecord,
        tmk:LegalConcept ;
    rdfs:comment "Summary, not a definition: Summary: International registration of a trade mark is registration of that mark in the International Register, rather than its protection specifically in Australia."@en-AU ;
