    tmk:expertShouldCheck "The concept's record distinguishes colour used as the mark from colour as an aspect of packaging or of a label. Those are arguably two things, and only one of them is subject matter. Whether the four sign kinds — shape, colour, sound, scent — are subject matter in their own right or facets of GC-0073 sign, which would make them narrower concepts under it rather than siblings beside it."@en-AU ;
